            ></path></svg
          >
        </a>
        <a class="icon-link" href="https://x.com/aleksgjoreski" target="_blank">
          <svg
            viewBox="0 0 768 773"
            xmlns="http://www.w3.org/2000/svg"
            class="x-svg"
          >
            <path
              d="M314.594 440.792L314.886 441.198L315.698 440.614L315.406 440.208L314.594 440.792ZM430 302.5L429.595 302.793L429.975 303.318L430.386 302.817L430 302.5ZM677.886 1.31725C678.062 1.10381 678.031 0.788746 677.817 0.613536C677.604 0.438325 677.289 0.469315 677.114 0.682753L677.886 1.31725ZM315 440.5L315.406 440.208L14.0749 21.2145L13.669 21.5064L13.2631 21.7983L314.594 440.792L315 440.5ZM23.4112 2.5V3H183.421V2.5V2H23.4112V2.5ZM229.569 26.0428L229.164 26.3363L429.595 302.793L430 302.5L430.405 302.207L229.973 25.7494L229.569 26.0428ZM430 302.5L430.386 302.817L677.886 1.31725L677.5 1L677.114 0.682753L429.614 302.183L430 302.5ZM183.421 2.5V3C201.527 3 218.536 11.6775 229.164 26.3363L229.569 26.0428L229.973 25.7494C219.158 10.8311 201.847 2 183.421 2V2.5ZM13.669 21.5064L14.0749 21.2145C8.60363 13.6068 14.0404 3 23.4112 3V2.5V2C13.2255 2 7.31602 13.5291 13.2631 21.7983L13.669 21.5064Z"
